<title>USA: Doe Run Co cuts lead price two cents to 48 cts.</title>
<headline>Doe Run Co cuts lead price two cents to 48 cts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Doe Run Co said it cut its price for corroding grade lead to 48 cents a lb from 50 cents, effective immediately.</p>
<p>This price is FOB Herculaneum, Mo., and Boss, Mo., with full freight allowed for carload quantities.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
